/*!
 * @example servo-loop.cxx
 *
 * @par [en] A complete program: one motor, one control loop, no hardware. [zh] 完整程序：一个电机、一条控制环、不需要硬件。
 * @section tutorial_shows [en] What the example shows [zh] 这个例子展示了什么
 * @par [en] The nameplate as plain data, the four policies chosen once at compile time, the lifecycle init -> start -> tick -> stop, and reading the telemetry back without touching internals.
 * @par [zh] 铭牌就是普通数据、四个策略在编译期一次性选定、生命周期 init -> start -> tick -> stop，以及只读遥测而不触碰内部状态。
 *
 * @section tutorial_why [en] Why the loop looks the way it does [zh] 控制环为什么长这样
 * @par [en] tick() is the ISR entry: noexcept, no allocation, no I/O. Everything that can fail at run time returns an ErrorCode instead of throwing. The tuning helpers foc::current_pi_config and foc::speed_pi_config live in the library, so the C path, the SIL bench and your board all start from the same numbers.
 * @par [zh] tick() 是 ISR 入口：noexcept、不分配、不做 I/O。运行期可能失败的地方一律返回 ErrorCode，不抛异常。整定辅助函数 foc::current_pi_config 与 foc::speed_pi_config 放在库里，保证 C 路径、SIL 台架与你的板子从同一组数出发。
 *
 * @section tutorial_hw [en] Taking it to hardware [zh] 上真实硬件
 * @par [en] Replace foc::driver::StubHal with your own HalPolicy (the four members pwm, current_sense, position, dc_link); nothing else changes. Dead-time compensation, ADC timing and ISR worst-case time are not verified by this library.
 * @par [zh] 把 foc::driver::StubHal 换成你自己的 HalPolicy（四个成员 pwm、current_sense、position、dc_link），其余不动。死区补偿、ADC 时序与 ISR 最坏执行时间没有被本库验证。
 *
 * @section servo_loop_numbers [en] The numbers behind the figure [zh] 图背后的数字
 * @par [en] One run of the SIL bench, the same executable the figure comes from: a PMSM plant in
 *      the loop, the current and speed PIs closed at the rates the library is tuned for.
 *
 * \image html ALL_demo_current_step.png "Current step on the SIL bench" width=760px
 *
 * | Scenario | Metric | Value |
 * |----------|--------|-------|
 * | current step, +1 A then -1 A | settling time (5 %) | 0.9 ms |
 * | current step, +1 A then -1 A | overshoot | 0.00 % |
 * | current step, +1 A then -1 A | steady-state error | 0.0101 A |
 * | speed step | settling time (2 %) | 69 ms |
 * | speed step | overshoot | 1.08 % |
 * | speed step | steady-state error | -0.9067 rad/s |
 * | sine tracking | worst error, of amplitude | 2.54 % |
 *
 * @par [zh] SIL 台架的一次运行，与图同一个可执行文件：PMSM plant 在环内，电流环与速度环按库调好的速率闭合。
 *
 * \image html ALL_demo_current_step.png "SIL 台架上的电流阶跃" width=760px
 *
 * | 场景 | 指标 | 数值 |
 * |------|------|------|
 * | 电流阶跃，先 +1 A 再 −1 A | 调节时间（5 %） | 0.9 ms |
 * | 电流阶跃，先 +1 A 再 −1 A | 超调 | 0.00 % |
 * | 电流阶跃，先 +1 A 再 −1 A | 稳态误差 | 0.0101 A |
 * | 转速阶跃 | 调节时间（2 %） | 69 ms |
 * | 转速阶跃 | 超调 | 1.08 % |
 * | 转速阶跃 | 稳态误差 | -0.9067 rad/s |
 * | 正弦跟踪 | 最大误差（占幅值） | 2.54 % |
 *
 * @include servo-loop.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link the aggregate target `foc::foc`; a C consumer additionally needs LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX. [zh] 链接聚合目标 `foc::foc`；C 使用者另外需要把 LINKER_LANGUAGE 设为 CXX。
 *
 * @since 0.1.0
 */
